  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x2DD" flags="0x0">
    <title>Spark Trim Engine Temperature Accelerating  B5D9</title>
    <description>Influences spark &#176;BTDC when opening and closing TPS. Values are signed values.&#013;&#010;If $00, no influence on spark timing&#013;&#010;$01-$7F, increased spark timing. Higher value equals more spark advance, conversion is x/2. The increased timing decays at ~24&#176;/s if TPS is held constant.&#013;&#010;$80-$ff, decreased spark timing. </description>
